  "finding": "The Core mixer demonstrably drops original PCM: 131 burst trims discard125760 samples (2.62seconds summed across distinct source owners). Collection is deferred155 times and taking the next original quantum139 times. These counters identify a downstream loss mechanism; they do not establish which transient metadata check causes each deferral.",
