  ],
  "next_fix": "Locate the unavailable current metadata check causing mixer collection/take deferral, then remove that contention or retry the same still-current original packet within its existing deadline without adding one full20ms mixer period per refusal. Preserve revocation, expiry, generation, scene and source ownership tests."
